    "long_instructions": "###Make your page easier to read\r\n\r\n1. Look at your project.\r\n2. Find one section that is hard to read. For example, a paragraph or a button.\r\n3. Figure out why. Is the text too small? Is the color too close to the background? Is the wording confusing or too long?\r\n4. Tell the AI which section to change and what would make it easier to read.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Make the button text white so it is easier to read against the background.”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it name the section you want to change? Does it say how to make it easier to read?",
